<view class="page">

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="pad">
    <view class="sk sk-line" style="width:200rpx"></view>
    <view class="sk sk-box"></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty">
    <image class="empty-img" src="/assets/icons/illustration-empty.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="empty-title">{{error}}</view>
    <view class="btn-tertiary" bindtap="onRetry">重试</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card-flush hero">
      <image class="avatar" src="/assets/icons/icon-user.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view class="hero-body">
        <view class="hero-title">我的账号</view>
        <view class="hero-sub tiny">{{userId}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card-flush">
      <view class="row">
        <image class="row-icon" src="/assets/icons/icon-qr.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="row-title">已创建的活码</text>
        <text class="row-value">{{campaignCount}} 个</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{devMode}}" class="card-flush">
      <view class="row">
        <image class="row-icon" src="/assets/icons/icon-warning.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="row-title">当前为体验模式</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-text">还没有配置小程序的登录凭证，现在用的是临时账号。配置好之后会用真实的微信身份登录。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-title">关于数据</view>
    <view class="card-flush">
      <view class="row-row row-row-col">
        <text class="row-row-label">统计口径</text>
        <view class="tiny muted about-text">这里统计的是扫码后打开页面的次数，不是成功添加好友或进群的人数。系统不读取你的微信好友、聊天记录，也不要求访客授权。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-title">其他</view>
    <view class="card-flush">
      <view class="row row-hover" bindtap="onClearCache">
        <image class="row-icon" src="/assets/icons/icon-refresh.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="row-title">清除本地缓存</text>
        <image class="row-arrow" src="/assets/icons/icon-chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <view class="row row-hover btn-danger" bindtap="onLogout">
        <image class="row-icon" src="/assets/icons/icon-close.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="row-title btn-danger">退出登录</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="spacer-h"></view>
  </block>

</view>
